Exercise 1: Create a File

Create createfile.groovy

Groovy
def file = new File("student.txt")
 
file.text = "Hello Groovy"
println "File Created"

Run:

Shell
groovy createfile.groovy

Check:

Shell
ls
cat student.txt

Output:

Plain Text
Hello Groovy
