Real Jenkins Pipeline Connection

A Jenkins pipeline uses closures extensively:

Groovy
pipeline {
agent any
 
stages {
 
stage('Build') {
steps {
echo 'Building Application'
}
}
 
stage('Deploy') {
steps {
echo 'Deploying Application'
}
}
 
}
}

The { } blocks in Jenkins are Groovy closures.

